# Inlang writes these two on every `paraglide-js compile`, in its own
# formatting. They are untracked (project.inlang/.gitignore keeps everything
# but settings.json out of git) — but Prettier only reads the *root*
# .gitignore, so on CI, where the compile step regenerates them, it would
# check files that no commit can ever fix. settings.json is hand-edited and
# stays linted.
